@Hozelo.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5193

### 1. Cadastrar a conta da família (201; repetir dá 409)
# @name register
POST {{Hozelo.Api_HostAddress}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Família Silva",
  "email": "familia@exemplo.com",
  "password": "senha1234"
}

### 2. Entrar (200; senha errada dá 401; 5 erros seguidos dão 429)
# @name login
POST {{Hozelo.Api_HostAddress}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "familia@exemplo.com",
  "password": "senha1234"
}

### 3. Ver o perfil com o token do login (200)
GET {{Hozelo.Api_HostAddress}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.tokens.accessToken}}

### 4. Ver o perfil sem token (401)
GET {{Hozelo.Api_HostAddress}}/users

### ---------------- Feature 002: categorias, despesas e parcelas ----------------
@token = {{login.response.body.$.tokens.accessToken}}

### 5. Criar categoria (201; repetir com outra caixa dá 409)
# @name category
POST {{Hozelo.Api_HostAddress}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Carro" }

### 6. Listar categorias (ordem alfabética, com quantidade de despesas)
GET {{Hozelo.Api_HostAddress}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Renomear categoria (204)
PUT {{Hozelo.Api_HostAddress}}/categories/{{category.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Carro da família" }

### 8. Registrar despesa à vista (1 parcela)
POST {{Hozelo.Api_HostAddress}}/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Conta de água de novembro",
  "categoryId": {{category.response.body.$.id}},
  "amountType": "Total",
  "amount": 120.00,
  "isInstallment": false,
  "installmentsCount": 1,
  "firstDueDate": "2026-12-10"
}

### 9. Registrar financiamento informando a parcela, com 22 já pagas
# @name expense
POST {{Hozelo.Api_HostAddress}}/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Financiamento do carro",
  "categoryId": {{category.response.body.$.id}},
  "amountType": "Installment",
  "amount": 1250.00,
  "isInstallment": true,
  "installmentsCount": 48,
  "firstDueDate": "2025-01-10",
  "alreadyPaidInstallments": 22,
  "notes": "Banco X"
}

### 10. Detalhe com parcelas
GET {{Hozelo.Api_HostAddress}}/expenses/{{expense.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. Listar despesas (filtros opcionais: categoryId, status=Open|Paid)
GET {{Hozelo.Api_HostAddress}}/expenses?status=Open
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 12. Pagar a parcela 23 (corpo opcional: { "paidOn": "yyyy-MM-dd" })
POST {{Hozelo.Api_HostAddress}}/expenses/{{expense.response.body.$.id}}/installments/23/payment
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 13. Desfazer o pagamento da parcela 23
DELETE {{Hozelo.Api_HostAddress}}/expenses/{{expense.response.body.$.id}}/installments/23/payment
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 14. Amortizar as 6 últimas parcelas pagando R$ 6.000,00 (desconto de R$ 1.500,00)
POST {{Hozelo.Api_HostAddress}}/expenses/{{expense.response.body.$.id}}/amortizations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quantity": 6, "paidAmount": 6000.00 }

### 15. Visão mensal do mês atual (ou ?year=2027&month=1, &categoryId=...)
GET {{Hozelo.Api_HostAddress}}/installments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 16. Editar (mudar quantidade com parcelas amortizadas dá 400)
PUT {{Hozelo.Api_HostAddress}}/expenses/{{expense.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Financiamento do carro",
  "categoryId": {{category.response.body.$.id}},
  "amountType": "Installment",
  "amount": 1250.00,
  "isInstallment": true,
  "installmentsCount": 50,
  "firstDueDate": "2025-01-10"
}

### 17. Remover a despesa (204)
DELETE {{Hozelo.Api_HostAddress}}/expenses/{{expense.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
